{"product_id":"my-life-as-a-joke-the-my-life-series-4","title":"My Life as a Joke (The My Life series, 4)","description":"\u003cp\u003eDerek Fallon discovers all the angst that comes with being twelve―he just wants to feel grown up, but life gets in the way with a series of mishaps that make him look like a baby. He passes out during a worm dissection in science class, falls flat on his face in gym class and gets a fat lip that causes him to lisp all day, and his plans for a monster-truck party turn into a bouncy house disaster. Why isn't being in middle school as great as Derek imagined? Thankfully, with a little help from his friends―and, ironically, a Toys for Tots fundraiser―things seem like they could start shaping up at last.My Life as a Joke by Janet and Jake Tashjian is a Christy Ottaviano Book\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 149 x 217\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Janet Tashjian\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780805098501\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Hardcover\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 272\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45803735318681,"sku":"16RA-3-9780805098501","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68d5059b38559_My_Life_as_a_Joke__The_My_Life_series__4__Janet_Tashjian.jpg?v=1760808685","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/my-life-as-a-joke-the-my-life-series-4","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}